 {}: {e}\", path.display());\n            std::process::exit(1);\n        }\n    }\n}\n","message":"The file /Users/user/work/delegate-9-gate-lock/src/status_record.rs has been updated."}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-140abc77-1b0a-45b9-a029-9155f9c8c39b-54\nfc_97ae6019-18dd-97f2-b1de-3ad66b3e375c_5","startedAtMs":"1790846491591","completedAtMs":"1790846492249"},"model_call_id":"cf64fe77-700f-4a00-9174-0ecdd691d677-18-8sxg","session_id":"b6dfbf0d-2164-45e3-a9e5-f79f7585081e","timestamp_ms":1790846492229}
